  "domain": "infrastructure",
  "definition": "A debug linked node is a diagnostic artefact within a knowledge graph or ontology system \u2014 a placeholder page that is deliberately linked to from another node in order to verify that the wikilink resolution, graph edge creation, and link-traversal mechanisms are functioning correctly. It serves as a test fixture for the ontology pipeline, confirming that bidirectional link references are parsed, stored as edges, and retrievable through graph queries.",
